Error [E0121]: `arena` was given away earlier, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/mem_use_after_reset.jet:9:10
    |
  9 |     y :: arena.alloc(2)
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: after a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: acquire a new ``Arena`` resource; closed resources cannot be copied or reused
